## Purpose

Provide a reusable behavioral-contract template for repository-scoped model-assisted engineering.

## Why

Project context reduces repeated discovery, but stale or oversized instructions degrade decisions. This file documents behavior; it does not grant authorization or safely contain untrusted input.

## How

Replace every bracketed variable, remove non-applicable sections, verify commands and links, and keep secrets out. Review after material architecture or policy changes.

## When

Instantiate for repositories that need persistent agent guidance. Re-review after ownership, architecture, commands, scope, or policy changes.

